    "metadata":  {
                     "title":  "RiceFloodIT: Water Management in the Italian Rice Paddies Estimated from MODIS data",
                     "doi":  "10.5281/zenodo.4313730",
                     "publication_date":  "2021-12-30",
                     "description":  "\u003cp\u003eThis repository includes two datasets used in\u0026nbsp;Ranghetti et al. (2018) and Ranghetti \u0026amp; Boschetti\u0026nbsp;(2022) to analyse the\u0026nbsp;magnitude of a decreasing trend in the extent of submerged rice paddies during the rice-sowing period in the Italian rice district: methods used to generate these data from MODIS remote sensing imagery are described in these papers.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cul\u003e\n\t\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003effavg_2021.csv\u003c/strong\u003e: this dataset includes values of yearly FF\u003csub\u003eavg\u003c/sub\u003e\u0026nbsp;(averaged Flooding Fraction) at pixel level. Each record represent the FF\u003csub\u003eavg\u003c/sub\u003e value of a specific pixel in a specific year.\n\n\t\u003cul\u003e\n\t\t\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ex\u003c/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003ey\u003c/strong\u003e identifies the latitude and longitude of each record (in UTM32 coordinates);\u003c/li\u003e\n\t\t\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003esubdistrict\u003c/strong\u003e represent the sub-district ID of each pixel (\u0026quot;A\u0026quot; to \u0026quot;G\u0026quot;);\u003c/li\u003e\n\t\t\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eyear\u003c/strong\u003e is the year whose each record refers to;\u003c/li\u003e\n\t\t\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eff\u003c/strong\u003e is the FFavg value (range 0-1);\u003c/li\u003e\n\t\t\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ecount\u003c/strong\u003e is the number of MODIS images used to generate each FF\u003csub\u003eavg\u003c/sub\u003e aggregated value.\u003c/li\u003e\n\t\u003c/ul\u003e\n\t\u003c/li\u003e\n\t\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ews_2021.csv\u003c/strong\u003e: this dataset includes values of WS (proportion of Water-Seeded rice surface) at sub-district and district levels.\n\t\u003cul\u003e\n\t\t\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003esubdistrict\u003c/strong\u003e represent the sub-district ID of each record (\u0026quot;A\u0026quot; to \u0026quot;G\u0026quot;, plus \u0026quot;all\u0026quot; which identifies values aggregated at district level);\u003c/li\u003e\n\t\t\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eyear\u003c/strong\u003e is the year whose each record refers to;\u003c/li\u003e\n\t\t\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ews\u003c/strong\u003e is the WS value (range 0-1);\u003c/li\u003e\n\t\t\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ecount\u003c/strong\u003e is the number of pixels used to generate each WS aggregated record.\u003c/li\u003e\n\t\u003c/ul\u003e\n\t\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eCurrent data version (2021.01) includes estimated values in the period 2000-2021.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eReferences:\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eRanghetti, Luigi, Elisa Cardarelli, Mirco Boschetti, Lorenzo Busetto\u0026nbsp;and Mauro Fasola. 2018. \u0026ldquo;Assessment of Water Management Changes in the Italian Rice Paddies from 2000 to 2016 Using Satellite Data: A Contribution to Agro-Ecological Studies.\u0026rdquo; \u003cem\u003eRemote Sensing\u003c/em\u003e 10 (3). doi:\u003ca href=\"https://doi.org/10.3390/rs10030416\"\u003e10.3390/rs10030416\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eRanghetti, Luigi\u0026nbsp;and Mirco Boschetti. 2022. \u0026ldquo;Updated trends of water management practice in the Italian rice paddies from remotely sensed imagery.\u0026rdquo; \u003cem\u003eEuropean Journal of Remote Sensing\u003c/em\u003e 55\u0026nbsp;(1), pp. 1-9. doi:\u003ca href=\"https://doi.org/10.1080/22797254.2021.2002726\"\u003e10.1080/22797254.2021.2002726\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e",
